{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07316","headline":"同姜濬题裴式微余干东斋 · 刘长卿","name":"同姜濬题裴式微余干东斋","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"世事终成梦，生涯欲半过。\n白云心已矣，沧海意如何。\n藜杖全吾道，榴花养太和。\n春风骑马醉，江月钓鱼歌。\n散帙看虫蠹，开门见雀罗。\n远山终日在，芳草傍人多。\n吏体庄生傲，方言楚俗譌。\n屈平君莫吊，肠断洞庭波。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘长卿","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_07316.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07316","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}